  "solution": {
    "text": "Calcination involves heating of carbonates or hydrated oxides in absence of air.\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\therefore 2 \\mathrm{Cu}_{2} \\mathrm{~S}+3 \\mathrm{O}_{2} \\stackrel{\\Delta}{\\longrightarrow} 2 \\mathrm{Cu}_{2} \\mathrm{O}+2 \\mathrm{SO}_{2} ; \\text { is roasting }\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n(heating in a regular supply of air)."
